      "widgets_values": [
        "A cinematic, low-angle shot bathed in the golden hour glow of a deserted boardwalk. A massive sea turtle, ancient and impossibly graceful, balances precariously on a vintage skateboard. The setting sun casts long, dramatic shadows that stretch across weathered, salt-bleached wood planks, painting stripes of amber and deep indigo onto the scene. Mist hangs low over the sand dunes in the background, catching the last rays of diffused sunlight, giving everything an ethereal, dreamlike quality. The turtle's shell gleams with iridescent greens and muted golds under the warm light, contrasting sharply with the cool blues creeping into the shadows. The overall mood is one of surreal freedom, quiet rebellion, and nostalgic melancholy, captured with a wide aperture to achieve creamy bokeh in the background. Cinematic grading, volumetric lighting, hyperdetailed, Hasselblad 85mm lens."
      ]
